```
theorem measure_closedBall_mul_le_scalingConstant_pow {α} [PseudoMetricSpace α] [MeasurableSpace α]
    (μ : Measure α) [IsUnifLocDoublingMeasure μ] {K : ℝ} (hK : 1 ≤ K) {x : α} {r : ℝ}
